Hosted plug-ins (NAMp Rack):

  This program loads LV2 and VST3 plug-ins the user installed. It ships none except
  the five pedals named above, redistributes none, and claims no rights over any. A
  plug-in loaded into the rack runs under its own licence, and this project's MIT
  grant says nothing about it.
